    "description": {
      "content": "Public, unauthenticated market-data API for the Overlay Protocol — a decentralized perpetual-futures protocol on BNB Smart Chain (chain id 56). Covers the CoinGecko/CMC-style aggregator feed, the market catalog, and the charts price-overview feed. All endpoints are read-only and public. Trading itself is executed on-chain against Overlay smart contracts (Shiva, OverlayV1State); this API surfaces the off-chain data/indexing layer.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Overlay Protocol",
